    "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2023 gross claims outstanding were GBP 2,169.8m. During 2023 the syndicate recorded adverse prior-year reserve development (a net deficit) of GBP 41.5m (reported as a net reassessment of prior accident years), driven primarily by increased provisions for exposures arising from the Russia/Ukraine conflict and legacy weather-related large losses. The development represents a strengthening of reserves (approx. 1.9% of opening gross claims) and primarily affected Aviation, Special Risks (specialty lines), Marine and Energy portfolios, while several divisions benefited from benign attritional experience.",
